iarity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of discord and destruction between and the people of the mansion and a man who hides his thirst for revenge beneath a calm demeanor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does the fall await beyond Eden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or—</p>",
