                        "review": "Great story, great voice acting, great art. Overall, loved it. My first visual novel as well!\n\nReally liked Oscar's route's in particular. Felt their story was more in-depth compared to the rest. Truthfully, was left wanting to know more about their dynamic as I loved the story that was told between them. (Reason why I even bought the sequel, which is much more lighthearted in comparison)\n\nLoved that it was a darker story, and loved that it's a story about revenge. Play as the villain, or chose not to, it's up to you. Bittersweet storylines, filled with drama and some mystery as well!\n\nGame would be even better without Morris' route, but other than that, I enjoyed replaying it. A little sad they haven't released anything or seem to be working on anything after years, but I hope they're able to create other stories in the future. And I secretly hope it's Alex and Oscar centered haha.",
